# AGENTS.md is now a weave-COMPOSED artifact (#95): weave concatenates the
# `prose` fragments (AGENTS.base.md + AGENTS.local.md) + the skill menu into it.
# It is generated, so it is gitignored. Its SOURCES — AGENTS.base.md and
# AGENTS.local.md — are tracked (NOT ignored): they are the constitution + the
# per-repo extension that weave composes from.
